---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | The Cosy Canvas Co."
  description="Read the terms and conditions for hiring luxury bell tents and camping equipment with The Cosy Canvas Co. in Scotland."
>
  <div class="bg-[#111111] text-white py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-stone-800 relative z-30">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2">Last updated: March 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16 bg-stone-50/60">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">1. Booking & Payment Terms</h2>
        <p>Bookings made 28 days or more in advance require a 50% non-refundable deposit to secure dates and equipment. The remaining 50% balance is due 28 days prior to the check-in date. For reservations made within 28 days of check-in, 100% payment is required upon booking.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">2. Security Deposit Policy</h2>
        <p>A refundable £200.00 security deposit is taken at checkout. This covers accidental damage, missing inventory, or extreme soiling. The security deposit is automatically released to the original payment card within 48 hours of post-stay inspection.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">3. Weather Guarantee & Cancellations</h2>
        <p>All canvas bell tents are fully waterproofed and storm-rated. In the event of an official Met Office Amber or Red severe weather warning for your booked location, you may reschedule free of charge or receive a 100% refund.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">4. Campsite Permission & Pitch Access</h2>
        <p>Hirers are responsible for booking their chosen campsite pitch or securing landowner permission prior to our pitching team's arrival.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-[#111111] mb-2">5. Care & Safety</h2>
        <p>Smoking, open unshielded candles, and unauthorized heating appliances are strictly prohibited inside bell tents. All stoves provided by The Cosy Canvas Co. must be operated according to provided safety instructions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
